    "text": "2:43 I'm from India, and have many friends that went to the States for their higher studies. I can see them struggling now, and it saddens me that i can't do anything to help them from halfway across the globe. In fact, a friend who was planning to go last year ended up not going in fear of Trump's insane policies, and we both heave a sigh of relief whenever this topic comes up. To all the normal Americans that just want to live their lives, my thoughts and prayers go out to you in the hope that there is light at the end of this tunnel. And to all those that voted for Trump at any point of time... Look in the mirror, and ask yourselves if this is the life you want to live.",
